hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"217","Muhammad bin Yahya and Al-Abbas bin Abi Talib told us, they said: Ismail bin Aban Al-Warraq told us, Abu Uwais Al-Madani told us, on the authority of Sharhabeel, who is Ibn Saad, on the authority of Jabir bin Abdullah, said: The Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, was asked about impurity: Should he eat or sleep? He said: “If he performs his ablution for prayer.”"
